<title>USA: Bell Atlantic merger status to set payout level.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic merger status to set payout level.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic Corp said Friday its August quarterly payout amount will depend on whether or not the company's merger with NYNEX Corp is completed by July 10, the dividend's record date.</p>
<p>The company said it would pay a dividend of $0.74 per share if the deal is not completed by the deadline. If the merger has been completed by that time, Bell Atlantic said the dividend will increase by $0.03 to $0.77 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid August 1 to shareholders of record as of July 10 in either case.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
